                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17928036" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Tue, 18 Feb 2025 10:59:55 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After reviewing the code, it has been confirmed that upgrading the metadata does not require modifying the table prefix, meaning the working directory will not change, and there is no need to rebuild the models.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In Kylin5, the table structures/content of `job_info`, `job_lock`, and `audit_log` have changed. Considering the limited significance of migration, it is better to use new tables with updated names instead. &#160;&lt;br/&gt;
The new table names will be `job_info_v2`, `job_lock_v2`, and `audit_log_v2`.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
